#: ../developer/glossary.md:1
msgid "Glossary"
msgstr "术语表"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:3
msgid "The terms these pages use, roughly in the order you meet them."
msgstr "本站使用的术语，大致按你遇到它们的顺序排列。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:5
msgid "Requests and models"
msgstr "请求与模型"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:7
msgid "Model id"
msgstr "模型 id"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:8
msgid ""
"The name a client sends in the `model` field, such as `example-chat`: the"
" gateway's public name for a model, independent of what any provider "
"calls it."
msgstr "客户端在 `model` 字段里发送的名称，例如 `example-chat`：它是网关对外的模型名，与任何 provider 自己的叫法无关。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:11
msgid "Alias"
msgstr "别名（alias）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:12
msgid "Another name for the same model id, declared in the model's `aliases`."
msgstr "同一个模型 id 的另一个名称，在模型的 `aliases` 里声明。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:14
msgid "Model registry"
msgstr "模型注册表（model registry）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:15
msgid ""
"The `MODEL_CATALOG` setting: the database document that lists every model"
" id and its routes. See [Configuration](configuration.md)."
msgstr "`MODEL_CATALOG` 设置项：列出每个模型 id 及其路由的数据库文档。见[配置](configuration.md)。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:18
msgid "API key and provider key"
msgstr "API key 与 provider key"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:19
msgid ""
"An API key is what a client presents to the gateway; a provider key is "
"what the gateway presents to a provider. They are never the same "
"credential."
msgstr "API key 是客户端向网关出示的凭据；provider key 是网关向 provider 出示的凭据。两者绝不是同一个凭据。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:22
msgid "Routes and providers"
msgstr "路由与 provider"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:24
msgid "Route"
msgstr "路由（route）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:25
msgid ""
"One way of serving a model id: an entry in the model's `route` list "
"naming an adapter kind, a base URL, a credential and a weight. Several "
"routes let the gateway balance and fail over between them."
msgstr ""
"提供某个模型 id 的一种方式：模型 `route` 列表中的一项，写明 adapter kind、base "
"URL、凭据和权重。有了多条路由，网关就能在它们之间分流和回退。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:29
msgid "Endpoint"
msgstr "端点（endpoint）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:30
msgid ""
"The server a route sends requests to. \"Endpoint\" means the server, "
"\"route\" the configuration entry."
msgstr "路由把请求发往的服务器。“端点”指服务器，“路由”指配置项。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:33
msgid "`endpoint_id`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/glossary.md:34
msgid ""
"The key for one endpoint of one model, `<model-id>:<location>`: "
"`glm-4.6:local-12003` for local port 12003, `glm-4.6:zai-api` for a "
"hosted API. Circuit breakers, latency profiles and weight overrides are "
"keyed on it. The suffix comes from the host and port or the adapter kind,"
" so it does not tell you who runs the server."
msgstr ""
"某个模型的某个端点的键，格式为 `<model-id>:<location>`：本地 12003 端口上的服务器是 "
"`glm-4.6:local-12003`，托管 API 是 `glm-4.6:zai-"
"api`。熔断器、延迟画像和权重覆盖都以它为键。后缀来自主机和端口或 adapter kind，因此看不出服务器由谁运行。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:40
msgid "Provider"
msgstr "provider"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:41
msgid ""
"The service behind a route: OpenRouter, DeepSeek, your own vLLM server. A"
" route's `provider` is the label its traffic is reported under."
msgstr "路由背后的服务：OpenRouter、DeepSeek，或你自己的 vLLM 服务器。路由的 `provider` 是它的流量在报告中使用的标签。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:44
msgid "Kind"
msgstr "kind"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:45
msgid ""
"A route's `kind`, which picks its adapter: `openai_compat`, `vllm`, "
"`openrouter`, `anthropic` and so on."
msgstr ""
"路由的 `kind`，决定使用哪个 adapter：`openai_compat`、`vllm`、`openrouter`、`anthropic`"
" 等。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:48
msgid "Adapter"
msgstr "adapter"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:49
msgid ""
"The code that speaks one provider's API: it builds the request, holds the"
" provider key and turns the response into the OpenAI shape. Self-hosted "
"servers use the generic OpenAI-compatible adapter."
msgstr ""
"与某个 provider 的 API 对话的代码：它构造请求、持有 provider key，并把响应转换成 OpenAI "
"格式。自部署的服务器使用通用的 OpenAI 兼容 adapter。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:53
msgid "Upstream"
msgstr "上游（upstream）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:54
msgid "Whatever the gateway calls to produce an answer: the far end of a route."
msgstr "网关为了得到回答而调用的对象：路由的另一端。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:56
msgid "Choosing a route"
msgstr "选择路由"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:58
msgid "Router"
msgstr "router"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:59
msgid ""
"The per-model logic, chosen with `router`, that picks a route for each "
"request. `fixed` (the default) draws a route by weight and falls back to "
"the others on failure; `routewise` trades latency against cost."
msgstr ""
"按模型配置、用 `router` "
"选择的逻辑，为每个请求挑选路由。`fixed`（默认）按权重抽取路由，失败时回退到其他路由；`routewise` 在延迟和成本之间权衡。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:63
msgid "Weight"
msgstr "权重（weight）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:64
msgid ""
"A route's relative share of traffic under `fixed`. A route with weight "
"`0` stays configured but gets no traffic, not even as a fallback."
msgstr "在 `fixed` 下，路由所占流量的相对份额。权重为 `0` 的路由仍保留在配置中，但不接收任何流量，回退时也不会用到。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:67
msgid "Fallback"
msgstr "回退（fallback）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:68
msgid "Trying the model's remaining routes in order when a route fails."
msgstr "某条路由失败时，按顺序尝试模型的其余路由。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:70
msgid "Circuit breaker"
msgstr "熔断器（circuit breaker）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:71
msgid ""
"A per-endpoint switch that stops traffic to an endpoint after repeated "
"failures and lets one test request through after a cooldown."
msgstr "按端点设置的开关：连续失败后停止向该端点发送流量，冷却期过后放行一个试探请求。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:74
msgid "Offload route"
msgstr "卸载路由（offload route）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:75
msgid ""
"A route reserved for the requests a model's other routes cannot start in "
"time. See [Queue-wait offload](routing.md#queue-wait-offload)."
msgstr "为模型的其他路由无法及时开始处理的请求预留的路由。见[排队等待卸载](routing.md#queue-wait-offload)。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:78
msgid "Routing file"
msgstr "路由配置文件（routing file）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:79
msgid ""
"The optional `ROUTING_POLICY` setting: the default router, health-probe "
"settings and a local/remote weight split. See [The routing "
"file](configuration.md#the-routing-file)."
msgstr ""
"可选的 `ROUTING_POLICY` 设置项：默认 "
"router、健康探测设置和本地/远端权重划分。见[路由文件](configuration.md#the-routing-file)。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:83
msgid "Accounts and sign-in"
msgstr "账号与登录"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:85
msgid "Single sign-on (SSO)"
msgstr "单点登录（SSO）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:86
msgid ""
"Signing in to the console with an account an organization manages, "
"instead of a password kept by the gateway. See [Single Sign-On](sso.md)."
msgstr "用机构管理的账号登录控制台，而不是用网关保存的密码。见[单点登录](sso.md)。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:89
msgid "Identity provider"
msgstr "身份提供方（identity provider）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:90
msgid ""
"The organization's system that signs its members in and tells the "
"gateway, over OpenID Connect (OIDC), who they are."
msgstr "机构用来让成员登录、并通过 OpenID Connect（OIDC）告诉网关他们是谁的系统。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:93
msgid "Link"
msgstr "关联（link）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:94
msgid ""
"The record that lets an identity at an identity provider sign in to one "
"account. An account can hold links to several identity providers."
msgstr "让身份提供方中的某个身份登录到某个账号的记录。一个账号可以关联多个身份提供方。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:97
msgid "Deployments"
msgstr "部署"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:99
msgid "Distribution"
msgstr "发行版（distribution）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:100
msgid ""
"One deployment's code, assets and Compose settings, kept in "
"`distributions/<name>/`. Its application settings (identity, branding, "
"model catalog) live in the database. `distributions/example/` is the "
"tutorial."
msgstr ""
"一个部署的代码、资源和 Compose 设置，放在 `distributions/<name>/` "
"中。它的应用设置（站点信息、品牌、模型目录）保存在数据库里。`distributions/example/` 是教程。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:104
msgid "Overlay"
msgstr "overlay"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:105
msgid ""
"The `distributions/<name>/` directory itself, mounted over the neutral "
"image instead of built into it."
msgstr "`distributions/<name>/` 目录本身，它挂载在中立镜像之上，而不是构建进镜像。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:108
msgid "Manifest"
msgstr "manifest"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:109
msgid ""
"The retired configuration file `distributions/<name>/distribution.yaml`. "
"Its settings now live in Admin's `SITE_CONFIGURATION` document and "
"startup no longer reads it; `python -m serving.config.manage import-"
"legacy` imports an old one once."
msgstr ""
"已停用的配置文件 `distributions/<name>/distribution.yaml`。其中的设置现在位于 Admin 的 "
"`SITE_CONFIGURATION` 文档中，启动时不再读取它；`python -m serving.config.manage "
"import-legacy` 可以把旧文件导入一次。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:114
msgid "Dry run and active"
msgstr "试运行与生效（dry run / active）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:115
msgid ""
"The modes of the retired `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE` setting: `active` "
"applied a manifest, and the dry run (`dark`) only compared it."
msgstr ""
"已停用的 `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE` 设置的两种模式：`active` 会应用 "
"manifest，试运行（`dark`）只做比较。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:118
msgid "Operational store"
msgstr "运行数据存储（operational store）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:119
msgid ""
"The Postgres tables that hold accounts, API keys and everything changed "
"in the admin console."
msgstr "保存账号、API key 以及在管理控制台中所做的一切修改的 Postgres 表。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:122
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "设置项（setting）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:123
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A value the gateway reads by name, such as `SMTP_PASSWORD` or a `${VAR}` "
"the model registry names. With a database, settings are stored there and "
"edited on the admin console's Settings tab; the environment only supplies"
" starting values. See [Settings stored in the database](configuration.md"
"#settings-stored-in-the-database)."
msgstr ""
"网关按名称读取的值，例如 `SMTP_PASSWORD`，或模型注册表引用的 `${VAR}`。有数据库时，设置项保存在数据库中，并在管理控制台的"
" Settings 标签页上编辑；环境变量只提供初始值。见[存储在数据库中的设置项](configuration.md#settings-"
"stored-in-the-database)。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:129
msgid "Live group"
msgstr "实时配置组"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:130
msgid ""
"Settings the gateway applies together without a restart once an operator "
"activates the group: every backend process validates the set, switches to"
" it and reports that it has. `alerts.runtime` is currently the only one. "
"See [Settings that apply without a restart](configuration.md#settings-"
"that-apply-without-a-restart)."
msgstr ""
"运营者启用这个组之后，网关无需重启即可一起应用的一组设置项：每个后端进程都会校验整组设置、切换过去并报告已切换。目前只有 "
"`alerts.runtime` 这一组。见[无需重启即可生效的设置项](configuration.md#settings-that-"
"apply-without-a-restart)。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:135
msgid "First-run setup"
msgstr "首次运行设置（first-run setup）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:136
msgid ""
"How a new deployment gets its first administrator: the backend logs a "
"one-time setup code, and whoever enters it on the console's `/setup` page"
" creates the account. See [First-run setup](installation.md#first-run-"
"setup)."
msgstr ""
"新部署获得第一位管理员的方式：后端在日志里输出一次性设置码，在控制台 `/setup` "
"页面输入该设置码的人即可创建账号。见[首次运行设置](installation.md#first-run-setup)。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:140
msgid "Runtime model"
msgstr "运行时模型（runtime model）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:141
msgid ""
"A model created in the admin console instead of the model registry. It "
"exists only in the operational store."
msgstr "在管理控制台中创建、而不是在模型注册表中定义的模型。它只存在于运行数据存储中。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:144
msgid "Console"
msgstr "控制台（console）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:145
msgid ""
"The Next.js web app: sign-up and sign-in, the user dashboard, the "
"playground and the admin console. It also forwards API paths to the "
"gateway; see [The public path table](public-path-table.md)."
msgstr ""
"Next.js 网页应用：注册和登录、用户仪表盘、对话调试页（playground）和管理控制台。它还会把 API 路径转发给网关，见[公开路径表"
"](public-path-table.md)。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:149
msgid "Site UI module"
msgstr "Site UI 模块（Site UI module）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:150
msgid ""
"A distribution's own React components for the public pages, compiled into"
" its console image. See [Site UI Modules](site-ui-modules.md)."
msgstr "发行版为公开页面编写的 React 组件，编译进它自己的控制台镜像。见 [Site UI 模块](site-ui-modules.md)。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:153
msgid "Backend extension"
msgstr "后端扩展（后端 extension）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:154
msgid ""
"A trusted Python module loaded at startup to add an adapter kind, a Cloud"
" Agent access rule or a quota source. See [Backend Extensions](backend-"
"extensions.md)."
msgstr ""
"启动时加载的受信任 Python 模块，用来添加 adapter kind、Cloud Agent 访问规则或配额来源。见[后端扩展"
"](backend-extensions.md)。"

